    "Id": "chassisdef_exterminator_iic_EXT-IIC",
    "Name": "Exterminator",
    "Details": "A IIC version of the Exterminator used by the Clans that invaded the Inner Sphere. Rebuilt almost from scratch the design is fully Clan technology based, mounting six ER Medium Lasers and an LRM-10 with attached Artemis IV FCS. Two Anti-Missile Systems provide self-defense.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>",
